   "fix": "Rephrase as \"... then `f` is \u00e9tale on an open neighbourhood of `x`\".",
   "issue": "Docstring says the point \"has an \u00e9tale neighbourhood\". That term means an \u00e9tale map into X, a different and weaker notion. The statement proves `\u2203 U : X.Opens, x \u2208 U \u2227 Etale (U.\u03b9 \u226b f)`, i.e. f is \u00e9tale on a Zariski-open set around x.",
